    "t5635a22f": "Discover Our Solutions",
    "tn31bc30c9": "\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"link-39\" data-text=\"t2268ff\">Home</a> • <a href=\"about-us\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"link-39\">About Us</a>\n    ",
    "t76c1f933": "With decades of experience, we help businesses grow smarter, move faster and stay competitive.",
    "t2ee6d719": "Explore Our Solutions",
    "tb280791": "Explore &nbsp;Career",
    "t63a541c": "Shaping The Digital Future",
    "tn21891215": "More than a tech firm we are a long-term partner helping business innovate, scale and stay ahead.",
    "t3dba0078": "Our Mission",
    "t3062bfdd": "To design technology solutions that create measurable impact and lasting value.",
    "tn6243b084": "Our Vision",
    "t106a2865": "To help businesses thrive by uniting exceptional talent with cutting-edge technology.",
    "tn62b76f4a": "Our Values",
    "t2fed2d8": "Integrity, trust, customer service, collaboration, innovation, knowledge, and perfection.",
    "tn45508378": "A story of growth driven by people, technology and trust. Each milestone reflects our commitment to progress, innovation, and lasting partnerships.",
    "t1774c4": "2006",
    "t129cf876": "Company Foundation",
    "t205acbbc": "Founded in Manchester, CT, laying the groundwork for two decades of success.",
    "t1774e4": "2017",
    "tn1c82938b": "Industry Recognition",
    "t1cd3964": "Named \"Best Place to Work in Connecticut,\" highlighting our commitment to a positive work environment.",
    "t1774fc": "2020",
    "t71d46882": "Global Expansion",
    "t474b3037": "Expanded globally with new offices in Dubai, U.A.E., and Hyderabad, India.",
    "t177501": "2025",
    "t74d91f53": "Current Standing",
    "t11637fb2": "A leading provider of IT solutions and staffing services, also a GSA Approved Vendor and a Certified MBE.",
    "tn42d46ca0": "Build, modernize, or solve complex business challenges with end-to-end custom software solutions.",
    "t2c822845": "Corporate",
    "tn518568b6": "Product Development",
    "tn6513d274": "Tailored Solutions",
    "t75587434": "System Modernization",
    "tn5d69c9f9": "Global Experience",
    "tn13ae193d": "Trusted for end-to-end custom development by tech businesses and Fortune 500 companies worldwide.",
    "t2a3c220e": "Expert Partnership",
    "t7b1d3480": "Certified experts partnering with you from strategy and design to deployment and scale.",
    "tn2e58c6f4": "Full-Cycle Delivery",
    "tn6e1f22a0": "Complete lifecycle support from discovery to deployment and long-term optimisation.",
    "t4e0c2954": "AI, Data &amp; Intelligent Automation",
    "t4fb6db40": "Building smart, data-driven products using AI, ML, and advanced analytics.",
    "t586cddfc": "Cloud-Native &amp; Distributed Systems",
    "t218b0e03": "Scalable, high-performance solutions leveraging cloud, microservices, and modern platforms.",
    "t58ff00cf": "Security, Compliance &amp; Reliability",
    "t2bd722fd": "Enterprise-grade cybersecurity, governance, and resilient system design",
    "tn646571b": "Business-First Approach",
    "tn5c07ef68": "Deep understanding of your workflows, goals, and challenges before we build.",
    "t710b856e": "Custom Integrations",
    "t63f4b713": "Seamlessly connect with existing systems, tools, and third-party platforms",
    "tn77366fc1": "Flexible &amp; Adaptive Solutions",
    "t30f5c46a": "Solutions that evolve as your business needs change.",
    "tn38820fdd": "Legacy System Transformation",
    "t5d5f6d6": "Modernize outdated systems for better performance and maintainability",
    "t52b8c3c6": "Cloud &amp; Platform Migration",
    "t30824437": "Move to scalable, cost-efficient, and secure cloud environments.",
    "tnfd1323d": "Performance &amp; Security Optimization",
    "t754404e7": "Improved speed, reliability, compliance, and long-term stability",
    "tn7a42e209": "We design and deliver strategic solutions that drive measurable business outcomes.",
    "t2995a1d1": "Modernise systems to improve performance, security and scalability.",
    "tn5ca0c924": "Turns ideas into validated solutions through research and rapid prototyping.",
    "t5aa974e2": "Align technology decisions with business goals &amp; long-term growth.",
    "tn5bd2e3ff": "Seamlessly add top-tier tech talent to your team. Boost your capabilities and accelerate delivery without the delays or costs of traditional hiring.",
